## Models

- `sauz-zeth/rubert-news-classification` is the project ruBERT classifier source:
  https://huggingface.co/sauz-zeth/rubert-news-classification
- The checked-out ONNX ruBERT artifact, when supplied locally, is expected at
  `ml_artifact/models/rubert_int4/` and includes `model.onnx`, `metadata.json`,
  and the tokenizer directory.
- BGE-M3 ONNX INT8 source: `skatzR/USER-BGE-M3-ONNX-INT8`, revision recorded in
  `ml_artifact/models/manifest.json`.
- BGE reranker ONNX INT8 source: `keisuke-miyako/bge-reranker-base-onnx-int8`,
  revision recorded in `ml_artifact/models/manifest.json`.
- The model artifacts are intentionally not committed. Download or receive them
  separately, verify their upstream licenses, and place them under
  `ml_artifact/models/` before enabling `ML_WORKER_ENABLED=true`.
- Hugging Face pages are the authoritative source for model-card licenses and
  usage restrictions; verify those terms before redistributing downloaded weights.

## Data and services

- RSS/Atom feeds, RSSHub, and any OpenAI-compatible LLM gateway are external
  services. The repository includes only source URLs and integration code.
- The demo uses synthetic companies, payments, events, and test accounts. Private
  hackathon CSV/PDF files and Telegram session files are not part of the release.
